notes = "(!) PS3UPDAT.PUP is installed on the first run; it may also be in system/rpcs3/.|(!) Game data, saves and the installed firmware live in system/rpcs3/ (dev_hdd0, dev_flash).|(!) Encrypted (redump) ISOs need a .dkey or .key file with the same name, next to the image or in system/rpcs3/data/redump/.|(!) Loading a .pkg installs it and boots the installed game.|(!) The Vulkan renderer (default) works with any video driver; the OpenGL renderer needs the glcore driver and OpenGL 4.5.|(!) Save states are not supported."

description = "A port of the RPCS3 PlayStation 3 emulator to libretro. It runs the Cell processor with RPCS3's LLVM recompilers and renders with Vulkan, handing each frame to the frontend through memory, or with OpenGL into the frontend's own context. Needs the PS3 system software (PS3UPDAT.PUP) in the system directory. Save states are not supported."
